{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Fisher matrix calculations for Continuous Gravitational Wave\n\nHere the source is considered to be a non-axisymmetric isolated neutron star.\n\nThis notebook contains the derivatives and the Fisher matrix calculations.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## CW model\n\nFor the waveform model, we use the $2f$ component of the GW signal, written exactly as it is generated in the TDFstat code.\n\nThe reference for the waveform model is: [Pia Astone et al. 2010](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1003.0844) and [Jaranowski et al. 1998](https://arxiv.org/pdf/gr-qc/9804014).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "At sample $i$ (time $t = i\\,\\Delta t$) the signal is\n\n$$h_i = A_{21}\\,h_{21} + A_{22}\\,h_{22} + A_{23}\\,h_{23} + A_{24}\\,h_{24},\\qquad\nh_{21} = a_i\\cos\\Phi_i,\\ \\ h_{22} = b_i\\cos\\Phi_i,\\ \\ h_{23} = a_i\\sin\\Phi_i,\\ \\ h_{24} = b_i\\sin\\Phi_i,$$\n\nwith the phase of the signal\n\n$$\\Phi_i = \\omega_0\\,(i + s_i) + \\omega_1\\,(i^2 + 2\\,i\\,s_i + s_i^2) + \\phi_\\mathrm{shift} - 2\\pi f_\\mathrm{po}\\,\\Delta t\\, i,$$\n\n$$\\omega_1 = \\pi\\dot f\\,\\Delta t^2,\\qquad \\omega_0 = 2\\pi f\\,\\Delta t + 2\\,\\omega_1 N_\\mathrm{ref},\\qquad\n\\phi_\\mathrm{shift} = \\omega_0 N_\\mathrm{ref} - \\omega_1 N_\\mathrm{ref}^2,\\qquad N_\\mathrm{ref} = N\\,(\\mathrm{seg} - \\mathrm{reffr}).$$\n\nThis is the same as\n\n$$\\Phi_i = 2\\pi f\\,t_i + \\pi\\dot f\\,t_i^2 - 2\\pi f_\\mathrm{po}\\,\\Delta t\\, i,\\qquad t_i = \\Delta t\\,\\left(i + s_i + N_\\mathrm{ref}\\right),$$\n\ni.e. a Taylor phase in the SSB time measured from the start of the reference segment.\n\n- $f,\\dot f$ are the frequency and spindown of the signal in the reference segment.\n- $s_i = \\vec n\\cdot\\vec r_i$: the detector position projected on the source direction, in units of $c\\,\\Delta t$.\n- $a_i$, $b_i$ are the modulation functions.\n- $A_{2k}$ are the amplitudes.\n- $f_\\mathrm{po}$ is the band frequency; the heterodyne term $-2\\pi f_\\mathrm{po}\\Delta t\\,i$ does not depend on the parameters.\n\nThe Mathematica names below follow the TDFstat code (`freqo0`, `freqo1`, `phaseshift`, `egam`, `ephi`, `omr`, `c1`…`c9`).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[\"Global`*\"];\n\nampPars   = {h0, iota, psi, phi0};\nphasePars = {f, fdot, alpha, delta};\npars      = {h0, f, fdot, alpha, delta, iota, psi, phi0};\n\n(* modulation functions (modvir) and Doppler shift n.DetSSB (kept abstract); i = sample index *)\naF = aa[alpha, delta, i];\nbF = bb[alpha, delta, i];\nsF = shift[alpha, delta, i];      (* n . DetSSB[i], in units of c*dt *)\n\n(* amplitudes: h0 * amplit[0..3] of signal_gen() *)\ncosip = (1 + Cos[iota]^2)/2;\nAmp = h0 {\n    Cos[2 psi] cosip Cos[phi0] - Sin[2 psi] Cos[iota] Sin[phi0],\n    Sin[2 psi] cosip Cos[phi0] + Cos[2 psi] Cos[iota] Sin[phi0],\n   -Cos[2 psi] cosip Sin[phi0] - Sin[2 psi] Cos[iota] Cos[phi0],\n   -Sin[2 psi] cosip Sin[phi0] + Cos[2 psi] Cos[iota] Cos[phi0]};\n\n(* phase of signal_gen(); Nref = N (seg - reffr) *)\nfreqo1     = Pi fdot dt^2;\nfreqo0     = 2 Pi f dt + 2 freqo1 Nref;\nphaseshift = freqo0 Nref - freqo1 Nref^2;\nPhi = freqo0 (i + sF) + freqo1 (2 sF i + i^2 + sF^2) + phaseshift - 2 Pi dt fpo i;\n\n(* cw modes h21, h22, h23, h24 *)\nmodes = {aF Cos[Phi], bF Cos[Phi], aF Sin[Phi], bF Sin[Phi]};\n\nh = Amp . modes;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {
    "timing": {
     "startTime": 1792411812449,
     "endTime": 1792411812461
    },
    "executionOrder": 19,
    "success": true
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Notation for the output\n\nDisplay only (`TraditionalForm`); the expressions keep their plain names.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "MakeBoxes[h0, TraditionalForm]     := SubscriptBox[\"h\", \"0\"];\nMakeBoxes[iota, TraditionalForm]   := \"\\[Iota]\";\nMakeBoxes[psi, TraditionalForm]    := \"\\[Psi]\";\nMakeBoxes[phi0, TraditionalForm]   := SubscriptBox[\"\\[Phi]\", \"0\"];\nMakeBoxes[fdot, TraditionalForm]   := OverscriptBox[\"f\", \".\"];\nMakeBoxes[alpha, TraditionalForm]  := \"\\[Alpha]\";\nMakeBoxes[delta, TraditionalForm]  := \"\\[Delta]\";\nMakeBoxes[dt, TraditionalForm]     := RowBox[{\"\\[CapitalDelta]\", \"t\"}];\nMakeBoxes[Nref, TraditionalForm]   := SubscriptBox[\"N\", \"ref\"];\nMakeBoxes[fpo, TraditionalForm]    := SubscriptBox[\"f\", \"po\"];\nMakeBoxes[egam, TraditionalForm]   := \"\\[Gamma]\";\nMakeBoxes[ephi, TraditionalForm]   := \"\\[Lambda]\";\nMakeBoxes[phir, TraditionalForm]   := SubscriptBox[\"\\[Phi]\", \"r\"];\nMakeBoxes[omr, TraditionalForm]    := SubscriptBox[\"\\[Omega]\", \"r\"];\nMakeBoxes[rx, TraditionalForm]     := SubscriptBox[\"r\", \"x\"];\nMakeBoxes[ry, TraditionalForm]     := SubscriptBox[\"r\", \"y\"];\nMakeBoxes[rz, TraditionalForm]     := SubscriptBox[\"r\", \"z\"];\nDo[With[{s = Symbol[\"c\" <> ToString[k]], b = SubscriptBox[\"c\", ToString[k]]},\n     MakeBoxes[s, TraditionalForm] := b], {k, 9}];\n\nnrBox = RowBox[{OverscriptBox[\"n\", \"\\[RightVector]\"], \"\\[CenterDot]\", OverscriptBox[\"r\", \"\\[RightVector]\"]}];\nMakeBoxes[sh, TraditionalForm]     := nrBox;\nMakeBoxes[cosPhi, TraditionalForm] := RowBox[{\"cos\", \"\\[ThinSpace]\", \"\\[CapitalPhi]\"}];\nMakeBoxes[sinPhi, TraditionalForm] := RowBox[{\"sin\", \"\\[ThinSpace]\", \"\\[CapitalPhi]\"}];\n\npdBox[num_, den_] := FractionBox[RowBox[{\"\\[PartialD]\", num}], RowBox[{\"\\[PartialD]\", den}]];\nMakeBoxes[daDalpha, TraditionalForm]  := pdBox[\"a\", \"\\[Alpha]\"];\nMakeBoxes[daDdelta, TraditionalForm]  := pdBox[\"a\", \"\\[Delta]\"];\nMakeBoxes[dbDalpha, TraditionalForm]  := pdBox[\"b\", \"\\[Alpha]\"];\nMakeBoxes[dbDdelta, TraditionalForm]  := pdBox[\"b\", \"\\[Delta]\"];\nMakeBoxes[dshDalpha, TraditionalForm] := pdBox[RowBox[{\"(\", nrBox, \")\"}], \"\\[Alpha]\"];\nMakeBoxes[dshDdelta, TraditionalForm] := pdBox[RowBox[{\"(\", nrBox, \")\"}], \"\\[Delta]\"];\n\n(* \"lhs = rhs\" table, and labels like dA21/diota *)\nparBox = <|h0 -> SubscriptBox[\"h\", \"0\"], iota -> \"\\[Iota]\", psi -> \"\\[Psi]\", phi0 -> SubscriptBox[\"\\[Phi]\", \"0\"],\n           f -> \"f\", fdot -> OverscriptBox[\"f\", \".\"], alpha -> \"\\[Alpha]\", delta -> \"\\[Delta]\"|>;\nlabels[name_, p_] := Table[DisplayForm[pdBox[SubscriptBox[name, \"2\" <> ToString[k]], parBox[p]]], {k, 4}];\nshow[lhs_, rhs_]  := TraditionalForm[Grid[Transpose[{lhs, ConstantArray[\"=\", Length[lhs]], rhs}], Alignment -> Left]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {
    "timing": {
     "startTime": 1792411812461,
     "endTime": 1792411812477
    },
    "executionOrder": 52,
    "success": true
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "h // TraditionalForm",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wexpr\"><wgraph class=\"resizable\" style=\"width:1616px;height:390px;\" aspect-ratio=\"0.2416\" tabIndex=\"-1\"><img class=\"invert-brightness\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" /></wgraph></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
