  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Derivatives\n\nThe amplitude parameters enter only through $A_{2k}$ and the phase parameters only through the modes $h_{2k}$:\n\n$$\\frac{\\partial h}{\\partial \\theta_A} = \\sum_{k=1}^{4} \\frac{\\partial A_{2k}}{\\partial \\theta_A}\\,h_{2k},\\quad \\theta_A \\in \\{h_0,\\iota,\\psi,\\phi_0\\};\n\\qquad\n\\frac{\\partial h}{\\partial \\theta_\\Phi} = \\sum_{k=1}^{4} A_{2k}\\,\\frac{\\partial h_{2k}}{\\partial \\theta_\\Phi},\\quad \\theta_\\Phi \\in \\{f,\\dot f,\\alpha,\\delta\\}.$$\n\nSo the pieces needed are, in order:\n\n1. $\\partial A_{2k}/\\partial\\theta_A$\n2. $\\partial h_{2k}/\\partial\\theta_\\Phi$, which contain $\\partial\\Phi/\\partial\\theta_\\Phi$, $\\partial a/\\partial\\alpha$, $\\partial b/\\partial\\alpha$, $\\partial(\\vec n\\cdot\\vec r)/\\partial\\alpha$ (and the same for $\\delta$)\n3. $\\partial a/\\partial\\alpha$, $\\partial a/\\partial\\delta$, $\\partial b/\\partial\\alpha$, $\\partial b/\\partial\\delta$\n4. $\\partial(\\vec n\\cdot\\vec r)/\\partial\\alpha$, $\\partial(\\vec n\\cdot\\vec r)/\\partial\\delta$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 1. Amplitude derivatives",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "dAmp = AssociationMap[D[Amp, #] &, ampPars];\n\nshow[labels[\"A\", h0], dAmp[h0]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
