  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 3. Modulation function derivatives\n\nThe coefficients in TDFstat, with $\\gamma$ as the orientation of the detector and $\\lambda$ as the latitude of the detector, are",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "cRules = {c1 -> 1/4 Sin[2 egam] (1 + Sin[ephi]^2), c2 -> -1/2 Cos[2 egam] Sin[ephi],\n          c3 -> 1/2 Sin[2 egam] Sin[2 ephi],      c4 -> -Cos[2 egam] Cos[ephi],\n          c5 -> 3/4 Sin[2 egam] Cos[ephi]^2,       c6 -> Cos[2 egam] Sin[ephi],\n          c7 -> 1/2 Sin[2 egam] (1 + Sin[ephi]^2), c8 -> Cos[2 egam] Cos[ephi],\n          c9 -> 1/2 Sin[2 egam] Sin[2 ephi]};\n\nshow[cRules[[All, 1]], cRules[[All, 2]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wexpr\"><wgraph class=\"resizable\" style=\"width:329px;height:370px;\" aspect-ratio=\"1.1265\" tabIndex=\"-1\"><img class=\"invert-brightness\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" /></wgraph></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      }
     ],
     "id": "90ac6c06-ef25-45d7-b091-4b44ba9a5797"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {
    "timing": {
     "startTime": 1792411815968,
     "endTime": 1792411816016
    },
    "executionOrder": 68,
    "success": true
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "$$c = \\cos x,\\quad s = \\sin x,\\qquad x = \\alpha - \\phi_r - \\omega_r\\, i,$$\n\n$$a = c_1(2-\\cos^2\\delta)\\,2c^2 + c_2(2-\\cos^2\\delta)\\,2cs + c_3\\sin\\delta\\cos\\delta\\,c + c_4\\sin\\delta\\cos\\delta\\,s - c_1(2-\\cos^2\\delta) + c_5\\cos^2\\delta,$$\n\n$$b = c_6\\sin\\delta\\,2c^2 + c_7\\sin\\delta\\,2cs + c_8\\cos\\delta\\,c + c_9\\cos\\delta\\,s - c_6\\sin\\delta.$$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "xF = alpha - phir - omr i;\ncc = Cos[xF];  ss = Sin[xF];\nc2d = Cos[delta]^2;  c2sd = Sin[delta] Cos[delta];\n\naExpl = c1 (2 - c2d) 2 cc^2 + c2 (2 - c2d) 2 cc ss + c3 c2sd cc + c4 c2sd ss - c1 (2 - c2d) + c5 c2d;\nbExpl = c6 Sin[delta] 2 cc^2 + c7 Sin[delta] 2 cc ss + c8 Cos[delta] cc + c9 Cos[delta] ss - c6 Sin[delta];\n\nabDerivs = {D[aExpl, alpha], D[aExpl, delta], D[bExpl, alpha], D[bExpl, delta]} /. xF -> x;\n\nshow[DisplayForm /@ {pdBox[\"a\", \"\\[Alpha]\"], pdBox[\"a\", \"\\[Delta]\"], pdBox[\"b\", \"\\[Alpha]\"], pdBox[\"b\", \"\\[Delta]\"]}, abDerivs]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wexpr\"><wgraph class=\"resizable\" style=\"width:1717px;height:195px;\" aspect-ratio=\"0.1137\" tabIndex=\"-1\"><img class=\"invert-brightness\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" /></wgraph></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      }
     ],
     "id": "4d06f267-b75c-4692-a8d6-306c2bcebcd3"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {
    "timing": {
     "startTime": 1792411816016,
     "endTime": 1792411816099
    },
    "executionOrder": 75,
    "success": true
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4. Doppler term derivatives\n\nThe unit vector to the source is $\\vec n = (\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\delta,\\ \\sin\\alpha\\cos\\delta,\\ \\sin\\delta)$ and the ephemeris $\\vec r = (r_x, r_y, r_z)$ is the detector position in the SSB frame, in units of $c\\,\\Delta t$, so\n\n$$\\vec n\\cdot\\vec r = r_x\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\delta + r_y\\sin\\alpha\\cos\\delta + r_z\\sin\\delta \\quad.$$\n\n$\\vec r$ depends only on $t$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
